1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, premium, professionally designed, fully responsive seven-page website for MK Vane, a man-and-van, removals, and transportation business based in Ipswich, Suffolk, United Kingdom.

The website should be long-form, elegant, informative, visually impressive, and conversion-focused. It must have a genuine professional design, detailed written content, excellent typography, smooth scrolling, and an intuitive booking interface.

Do not build a simple one-page landing page. Create seven fully separate pages with their own layouts, meaningful content, navigation, and SEO metadata. Every page should contain multiple well-designed sections and support natural vertical scrolling.

The central objective is to help customers understand the services, enter their collection and delivery locations, explain what needs moving, request a quote, and contact the business easily.

Build an experience that feels like a professional transport-booking platform, not a generic AI-generated website template.

